{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "RetroArch core -> console buttons, per RetroPad id (button_map_overlay_plan.md 3.1, each core's source at the shipped version). Values are anchor ids of the console's drawing (controllers.json), or the console's own name for a control the drawing lacks. RetroPad b/a/y/x are bottom/right/left/top. up/down/left/right go to the drawing's d-pad unless 'dpad' says otherwise (an anchor such as stick-l, or '' for none). lstick/rstick expand to <anchor>:up/down/left/right; l_x+ ... r_y- name one half. 'library' is the core's library_name, the folder RetroArch keeps its overrides, remaps and options in.",
